[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0337","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0337.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0335","title":"GNU glibc DNS 解析器预测性 ID 欺骗漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.3 中的 DNS 解析器使用可预测的查询 ID，本地攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 响应包，利用可预测的 ID 字段实施 DNS 缓存投毒攻击，将用户请求重定向至恶意站点，导致信息泄露或中间人攻击。该漏洞影响使用 glibc 2.1.3 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地网络访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0335"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.143","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 DNS 事务 ID 可预测问题。如无法升级，可在本地 DNS 解析器（如 BIND）上启用 DNSSEC 并限制递归查询来源，同时使用 iptables 限制仅允许可信 DNS 服务器响应，降低欺骗攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1166"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0337.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0337.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0311","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0311.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0378","title":"RedHat Linux pam_console 模块本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 系统 pam_console PAM 模块存在设备文件描述符泄露漏洞。当用户登录时，pam_console 会对各类设备文件执行 chown 操作以赋予当前用户访问权限，但在用户注销后，之前打开的设备文件描述符并未被正确关闭，导致已注销用户仍可保持对设备的访问能力。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞，在注销后持续监控后续用户登录时的设备活动，从而窃取敏感信息（如键盘输入、屏幕输出等）。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.0/6.1/6.2 版本，攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需额外认证即可实施监控，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0378"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35.513","remediation":"升级到包含修复的 pam 版本（pam-0.68 及以上），该版本在用户注销时正确关闭所有控制台设备文件描述符。如无法升级，可修改 /etc/security/console.perms 配置文件，移除 pam_console 对敏感设备（如 /dev/tty*、/dev/mouse、/dev/audio）的自动 chown 权限，或直接禁用 pam_console.so 模块（从 /etc/pam.d/login 中注释掉 session required pam_console.so 行）。对于仍在运行 Red Hat Linux 6.x 的系统，建议立即迁移到受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0023.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1176","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19900","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0378","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0378.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/711263a5c057385b05d3b3d477c7a317d9a9f37f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5949-54q2-grjg/GHSA-5949-54q2-grjg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bef28ef8-a6b1-4ae5-ae39-677d4184a250.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0311.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0311.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0311.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0294","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0303","title":"id软件 Quake3Arena 目录遍历漏洞","description":"id Software 出品的 Quake3 Arena 游戏存在目录遍历漏洞。恶意服务器运营者可向连接至服务器的客户端发送特制的包含 `../` 路径序列的数据包，绕过文件路径限制，实现对客户端文件系统中任意文件的读取或写入操作。攻击者无需认证，仅需诱使玩家连接至恶意服务器即可触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0303"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.143","remediation":"升级 Quake III Arena 至 1.16 或更高版本，该版本修复了目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，仅在客户端设置中禁用自动下载（set cl_allowDownload 0），并只连接可信任服务器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7531","http://www.quake3arena.com/news/index.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1169","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise50.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0303","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0303.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mcwg-hqg6-x568/GHSA-mcwg-hqg6-x568.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1029","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--904311c4-4e37-4b4f-b764-660a658f2bed.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0275","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0332","title":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 目录遍历漏洞","description":"UltraBoard 1.6 中的 UltraBoard.pl 或 UltraBoard.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在路径名字符串中包含\"..\"（点点）并以空字节结尾的方式，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞允许攻击者获取敏感配置文件、密码文件等未授权信息，危害中等。攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，影响运行 UltraBoard 1.6 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0332"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29.747","remediation":"立即升级 UltraBoard 至 1.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复输入验证缺陷。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 \"../\" 及空字节 (%00) 的请求路径；同时限制 CGI 脚本运行目录权限，确保 Web 用户无法读取 /etc/passwd 等系统敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1309","http://www.osvdb.org/4065","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1164","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000503091316.99073.qmail%40hotmail.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19890","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0332","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0332.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvp8-fccx-5j9w/GHSA-fvp8-fccx-5j9w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001342.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b24d4077-8f1a-4c11-ae3c-a83f91da091a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0275.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0275.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0470","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0433","title":"Suse Linux 权限提升漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 的 aaa_base 软件包将某些系统账户的主目录设置为 /tmp，本地用户可在 /tmp 下创建用户启动脚本（如 .profile、.bashrc 等），当这些系统账户登录或执行相关操作时会加载并执行攻击者植入的脚本，从而获得该系统账户的权限。该漏洞影响安装了有缺陷 aaa_base 包的 SuSE Linux 发行版，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并在 /tmp 目录写入恶意启动脚本，待目标系统账户登录或执行相关操作时触发代码执行，导致权限提升至对应系统账户权限，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0433"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43.377","remediation":"立即升级 SUSE Linux aaa_base 包到修复版本（建议升级至 SuSE 6.4 或更高版本的修复版本），通过 YaST 在线更新或从 SUSE 官方 FTP 下载修补包安装。临时缓解措施：检查 /etc/passwd 中系统账户（如 uucp、news 等）的主目录是否指向 /tmp，若是则修改为 /var/spool/该账户 等安全目录；同时设置 /tmp 目录粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp）并限制普通用户在 /tmp 创建可执行脚本的权限（chmod 1777 /tmp），防止本地用户通过放置恶意 profile 脚本劫持系统账户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_47.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0433.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0433","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0433.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0433.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mpxg-5frr-vc3r/GHSA-mpxg-5frr-vc3r.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88298/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0433.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--01fdcccd-20e4-427f-963b-0c46e4cb466a.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0405","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0386","title":"FileMaker FileMaker Pro Web Companion 匿名邮件发送漏洞","description":"FileMaker Pro 5 的 Web Companion 组件存在邮件中继漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该组件发送匿名或伪造的电子邮件。攻击者可通过向 Web Companion 发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用其默认配置下未对邮件发送功能进行访问限制的缺陷，将服务器作为垃圾邮件或钓鱼邮件的匿名中继节点。该漏洞影响 FileMaker Pro 5 及早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议用户禁用 Web Companion 的邮件功能或升级至更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0386"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.493","remediation":"立即升级 FileMaker Pro 5 Web Companion 至官方修复版本（5.0v3 或更高），该版本限制了邮件中继功能，防止匿名邮件发送。如无法升级，在 Web Companion 配置中禁用 SMTP 中继功能，仅允许经过身份验证的用户发送邮件；同时在网络防火墙层面限制对 Web Companion 端口（默认 80/443）的出站 SMTP 连接，阻止未授权的外部邮件转发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.blueworld.com/blueworld/news/05.01.00-FM5_Security.html","http://www.filemaker.com/support/webcompanion.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0386","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0386.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2ab41bf860e3367de1bb9a028a62363062358f8d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2xgp-3983-29gm/GHSA-2xgp-3983-29gm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88304/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0405.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0404","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0385","title":"FileMaker Pro Web Companion 安全绕过漏洞","description":"FileMaker Pro 5 Web Companion 组件存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 XML 发布功能或电子邮件功能绕过字段级数据库安全限制，实现对数据库字段的未授权修改。该漏洞影响 FileMaker Pro 5 版本，攻击者只需通过网络发送特制请求即可利用，无需复杂攻击条件，可能导致敏感数据被篡改。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0385"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.373","remediation":"升级至 FileMaker Pro 5.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 Web Companion 配置中禁用 XML 发布和电子邮件功能，并在防火墙层面限制对 Web Companion 端口（默认 80）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.blueworld.com/blueworld/news/05.01.00-FM5_Security.html","http://www.filemaker.com/support/webcompanion.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0385","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0385.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc954c015ec74fa656f6d2cb3eaa86c83e860239/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rvg-g59j-rvrh/GHSA-3rvg-g59j-rvrh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88333/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0404.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0351","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0346","title":"Apple AppleShare IP 6.x 信息披露漏洞","description":"AppleShare IP 6.x 网络共享服务器在 HTTP Range 请求头的验证处理中存在安全漏洞。当攻击者向服务器发送格式错误的范围请求头时，服务器未能正确解析或验证请求边界，导致对共享文件夹中存储的敏感文件进行目录遍历和信息泄露。该漏洞允许任何远程未认证攻击者通过特制的无效范围请求获取目录列表、文件内容等系统敏感信息，可能暴露企业的商业机密和用户数据。 CVSS 评估显示此漏洞评分为 5.0，等级为中危，影响主要集中在保密性层面，对完整性和可用性无直接影响，攻击者无需特殊条件即可远程触发。 AppleShare IP 6.x 用户应立即更新到最新版本，并采取服务器访问控制措施以限制敏感资源泄露的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0346"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.557","remediation":"建议立即升级 AppleShare IP 到 6.3.1 或更高版本（Apple 已在 2001 年发布的 AppleShare IP 6.3.1 修复了该漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理或 WAF 规则拦截包含无效 Range 头的 HTTP 请求（如 Range: bytes=-1,-2 等异常范围），或在防火墙层面限制 Web 服务仅对可信 IP 开放 80/443 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://asu.info.apple.com/swupdates.nsf/artnum/n11670","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1162","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000502133240.21807.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0346","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0346.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pp76-3w2g-vm3m/GHSA-pp76-3w2g-vm3m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--95543076-20db-4837-82c7-9166f71f32e7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0351.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0351.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0299","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0347","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 NetBIOS 空源名称拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 的 NetBIOS 协议实现存在空源名称处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 NetBIOS 会话请求数据包，其中源名称字段设置为 NULL，导致目标系统网络服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 和 Windows 98 系统，攻击条件低，仅需通过网络发送单个恶意数据包即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0347"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.690","remediation":"由于 Windows 95/98 已停止支持且无官方补丁，建议在防火墙或边界路由器上阻止 UDP 137-138 端口和 TCP 139 端口的入站流量，以阻断远程 NetBIOS 攻击。同时可在网络适配器属性中禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP，或升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）并启用 Windows Defender 防火墙。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95737580922397&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1163","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19889","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0347","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0347.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1239.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/netbios.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rfparalyze.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0299.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0296","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0343","title":"Brecht Claerhout Sniffit 日志记录缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sniffit 0.3.x 的 -L 日志记录选项存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Sniffit 服务发送特制的超长 MAIL FROM 邮件头触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Sniffit 0.3.6 HIP 及 0.3.7 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码（ID: 19888）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0343"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.160","remediation":"立即停止使用 Sniffit 0.3.x 系列版本，该软件已长期无人维护且无官方补丁。建议迁移至 Snort、tcpdump 或 Wireshark 等活跃维护的网络监控工具。如暂时无法替换，务必禁用 -L 日志记录选项（不使用 -L normmail 参数启动），并在防火墙层面限制 Sniffit 所在主机的 SMTP 端口（25）入站流量，降低远程触发风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1158","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200005021736.TAA01991%40ALuSSi","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19888","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0343","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0343.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q5jj-xjv6-mqg6/GHSA-q5jj-xjv6-mqg6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0257","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0293","title":"SuSE Linux aaa_base 任意文件删除漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.x 系统的 aaa_base（6.3 版本）及更早版本的 cron.daily 脚本在清理 /tmp 目录过期文件时存在空格文件名处理缺陷。由于脚本未对包含空格的文件名进行正确的引号包裹或转义处理，本地攻击者可在 /tmp 下创建文件名包含空格的特制文件，当 aaa_base 自动删除过期文件时，会将空格分割后的文件名片段解析为多个独立参数，导致系统意外删除其他非目标文件。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.x 系列，CVSS 2.1 低危，需本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0293"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24.927","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 至 6.4 及以上版本，或安装 SuSE 官方提供的 aaa_base 安全补丁。如无法升级，可修改 aaa_base 脚本中清理 /tmp 目录的逻辑，对文件名变量添加双引号包裹（如 `\"$file\"`）以防止 shell 通配符/空格解析错误，同时限制清理范围仅针对应用自身创建的文件而非全目录扫描。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1130","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19867","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0293.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0293","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0293.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0293.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmpr-c4ff-x7wm/GHSA-xmpr-c4ff-x7wm.json","https://github.com/CWE-CAPEC/REST-API-wg/blob/5a8974308ef38e8ee4979e4a29b3b3a22c647822/json_repo/W/48.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1130/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0293.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0123","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0138","title":"系统被植入 DDoS 攻击工具（Trinoo/TFN/TFN2K/stacheldraht/mstream/shaft）拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0138 描述了系统中被植入分布式拒绝服务（DDoS）攻击工具的情况，包括控制端（master）、代理端（agent）或僵尸程序（zombie）。具体涉及 Trinoo、Tribe Flood Network（TFN）、TFN2K、stacheldraht、mstream、shaft 等六种 DDoS 工具。攻击者通过这些工具在已被入侵的主机上建立僵尸网络，远程下发攻击指令，向特定目标发送大量恶意流量，导致目标网络带宽耗尽或系统资源枯竭，无法提供正常服务。攻击条件为攻击者已获得系统访问权限并安装了相应的 DDoS 恶意程序，危害程度中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0138"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.757","remediation":"使用最新病毒库的杀毒软件全盘扫描并清除 Trinoo、TFN、TFN2K、stacheldraht、mstream、shaft 等 DDoS 木马；在防火墙上封锁已知端口（Trinoo 的 1524/tcp、27444/udp、31335/udp，Stacheldraht 的 16660/tcp、65000/tcp，mstream 的 12754/tcp、15104/tcp）；检查系统自启动项、计划任务和异常网络连接，移除可疑进程和文件，并限制非必要对外通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95715370208598&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95722093124322&w=2","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise48.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0138","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0138.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0138.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/247.txt","https://github.com/universal-ctags/ctags/blob/5437fa6249e95ec55a5f4944dac28f4f6e46c195/Units/review-needed.r/too-large-for-reviewing-3526726.tex.t/input.tex","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/15e03a1f168cc2879e6a9485d5d70b74c6e6cf7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6w6r-f2f7-xh5j/GHSA-6w6r-f2f7-xh5j.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/doc/faq.tex","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/234.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/trinity.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0490","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0448","title":"网络联合 WebShield SMTP 管理工具 SMTP管理端口访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"WebShield SMTP管理系统4.5.44版本存在安全漏洞，该系统在处理未解析主机名的IP地址时，未能正确限制管理端口的访问权限，导致攻击者可通过GET_CONFIG命令远程访问系统配置。该漏洞影响范围广泛，只要存在网络通信，该管理工具均可受到影响，攻击者无需身份验证即可执行远程代码访问操作，最终可能导致敏感信息泄露，威胁到用户的网络安全。利用此漏洞攻击者可以通过发送特制网络请求来绕过访问控制机制，获取系统配置信息，并可能进一步利用获取的信息进行攻击。Microsoft已发布安全更新修复了此漏洞，建议用户及时进行系统更新以确保安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0448"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45.323","remediation":"建议立即升级至 WebShield SMTP 4.5.44 之后的修复版本（建议升级至 McAfee Security for Email Servers 最新版）。若无法升级，请在防火墙配置仅允许受信任管理IP访问 SMTP 管理端口（默认 8081/TCP），并在 DNS 服务器配置管理服务器 IP 的 PTR 反向解析记录，确保 IP 能正确解析为主机名以触发访问控制。若产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Microsoft Exchange Online Protection 或 Proofpoint Email Protection 等现代邮件安全网关。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/326","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1253","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=6C740781F92BD411831F0090273A8AB806FD4A%40exchange.servers.delphis.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0448.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c2