.5.50 或更高版本），官方补丁可通过 Network Associates 安全公告 NAI-2000-001 获取。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面封锁 WebShield 远程管理服务端口（默认 TCP 8080/8443），仅允许受信任管理网段访问，并禁用远程配置参数接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/327","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1254","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=6C740781F92BD411831F0090273A8AB806FD4A%40exchange.servers.delphis.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0447","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0447.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rgrc-m757-f2p2/GHSA-rgrc-m757-f2p2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001332.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--661b9657-78f7-4272-8f0e-4661f6be094c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0426","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0426.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0401","title":"PDGSoft Shopping Cart redirect.exe/changepw.exe 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PDGSoft 购物车系统中的 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向这两个组件发送超长查询字符串（query string）触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 PDGSoft 购物车早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害严重。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他替代方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0401"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.337","remediation":"立即从 PDGSoft 官方渠道（原 security2.html 页面）安装针对 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 的缓冲区溢出补丁。由于该产品已停止维护多年，强烈建议迁移至仍在安全更新的替代购物车系统。如无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面通过 URL 重写或访问控制规则，限制对 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 调用，并在输入参数长度上做严格限制（如截断超过 256 字节的 query string）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95928319715983&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95928667119963&w=2","http://www.pdgsoft.com/Security/security2.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1256","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0401","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0401.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/changepw.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/e7a1e0098ca50c8dc77455488033ca407ec81282/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1256/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab